## Scope

Sync/index legal documents, validity/version/relations, manual additions, duplicate detection, bookmarks/download/print and stale-reference warnings.

## Acceptance criteria

- Document validity is evaluated at the dossier/answer date.
- Replaced/expired documents retain relation history and trigger warning on public answer.
- Search returns chapter/article/clause/point references.
- Manual content is marked and audited separately from synchronized content.

